Fri Oct 23 06:52:21 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.13.0 (upstream tag v0.13.0, 2026-10-23):
  * Covers v0.10.0, v0.11.0, v0.12.0 and v0.13.0; 0.13.0 itself only
    validates CLI paths/arguments in upstream's dev tools.
  * Raw/import: Minolta MRW, tiled RW2 format 8 (DC-S1RM2 high-res),
    table-less packed Nikon NEFs, Lightroom lossy DNGs (JPEG XL
    tiles), Sony SR2/SRF folder import, Hasselblad FFF colour, TIFF
    strips/tiles over 128 MiB, AI Denoise for 102 MP Bayer raws.
  * Colour: X-Trans CMOS 4 spectral matrices, Kelvin white balance
    for Nikon Z5II and Canon CR2 presets, Nikon DSLR and Fujifilm
    lens profiles, A7CR embedded distortion, tone curve fixes.
  * Develop: Guided Upright guides editable, Alt-drag clipping
    previews, View Options for the loupe info lines, crop fixes
    (shape lock, orientation, spiral guide, tilted edges), SAM 3
    falls back to the CPU, HDR merge warps use Lanczos-3, GPU
    denoise fixed on DX12 with NVIDIA Pascal.
  * Library: search finds named people, large Lightroom catalogs
    read by page, album hierarchy kept on import, faster grid and
    File Path smart rules, stack badge, F8 and backslash shortcuts.
  * Hardening: stricter parsing of XMP, GPS, GPX, colours, URLs,
    redirects, dates and catalog/face index records; bounded TIFF
    entries, JPEG XL/HEIF sizes and brush strokes; commands and MCP
    params validated before mutation; idle control connections
    expire; date/time conversion now goes through chrono.
  * Translations: new Finnish, Indonesian, Swedish and Vietnamese;
    German, Czech, Italian, Polish and others updated.
  * Re-vendored (update=false kept for --locked, respect-lockfile
    true); only new crate is chrono 0.4.45 (MIT OR Apache-2.0), no
    other crate changed version; license re-derived over shipped
    targets, no new copyleft, tag stands; no new system deps, MSRV
    still 1.90; cargo_audit reports no advisories.
- Bump the fixed metainfo release date to 2026-10-23.
- Legal-Review-Notice: correct heic-rs version to 0.1.4 (pinned
  upstream since 0.8.0; the notice still said 0.1.1).

