Thu Oct 15 04:53:51 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.8.0 (upstream tag v0.8.0):
  * Export: HLG HDR AVIF, Render to DNG, resized exports keep the
    asked edge, merges keep the reference lens corrections.
  * Display: monitor profiles kept sharp when zoomed, Linux previews
    use the colord display profile, HDR histogram follows drags.
  * Import: HEIC/HEIF/NRW folder import, CR2 white level, ORF/NEF/PEF
    fixes, Leica Q3, Canon EOS RP, Nikon D90/D7100 frame fixes.
  * Library: portable mode via portable.txt, Synchronize Folder,
    Recently Deleted for Local photos, faces from previews.
  * Hardening: many never-crash fixes (mask/NEF/PEF/demosaic/export
    overflows, NaN inputs, damaged-catalog repair, preset zip cap).
  * Perf: 64 MP raws stay decoded on GPU, slider drags skip re-decode,
    smart previews at JPEG quality 97, heic-rs 0.1.4 (was 0.1.1).
  * Re-vendor with update=false; license audit finds no new copyleft
    (self_cell still Apache-2.0 option), so the License tag is
    unchanged. No CVEs in the v0.7.1 to v0.8.0 range.
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list.

